Format:   split PIL images (.mdt + .bNN), from build/ms/bin/5332.wlanfw.eval/PIL_IMAGES

Origin:   imported by JiaY-shi into the GL-BE6500 tree (4be26be3f3,
          "firmware: add GL-BE6500 ath12k firmware and board data");
          byte-identical to jiay/flint3e-support ddf329e7c9. The original
          source of the images was not recorded.

No WLAN.WBE.1.6 IPQ5332 build is published (as of 2026-09-23):
linux-firmware carries no IPQ5332 firmware,
git.codelinaro.org/clo/ath-firmware/ath12k-firmware only has
IPQ5322/hw1.0/board-2.bin, and github.com/quic/upstream-wifi-fw only has
IPQ5332 (5332.wlanfw) split images up to WLAN.WBE.1.3.1-00130, under
ath12k-firmware/IPQ5322/hw1.0. The ath12k legacy firmware support in this
tree targets WLAN.WBE.1.6-01270, so these images are kept in the tree.
The redistribution licence of this particular build has not been
established.

The QSDK debug files shipped with the original import (Data.msc,
qdss_trace_config.bin, *.flist) are not loaded by ath12k and are left
out, as is the standalone regdb.bin: the GL-BE9300 board-2.bin files
carry their own regdb.

